 static void Field(Panel row,string label,FrameworkElement control){row.Children.Add(new TextBlock{Text=L.T(label),Foreground=StudioTheme.Muted,VerticalAlignment=VerticalAlignment.Center,Margin=new Thickness(4,0,3,0)});row.Children.Add(control);}
 void Button(Panel panel,string text,Action action){var b=new Button{Content=L.T(text),Margin=new Thickness(2)};b.Click+=(_,_)=>Run(action);panel.Children.Add(b);}
 void Run(Action action){try{action();}catch(Exception e){Refresh();updating=true;try{MessageBox.Show(L.T(e.Message),L.T("표정 클립"));}finally{updating=false;}}finally{if(Window.GetWindow(this) is {} w)L.Apply(w);}}
 void BindEntry(TextBox box,Action action){box.KeyDown+=(_,e)=>{if(e.Key==Key.Enter){if(!updating)Run(action);e.Handled=true;}};box.LostKeyboardFocus+=(_,_)=>{if(!updating)Run(action);};}
 static double Number(TextBox b){if(!double.TryParse(b.Text,System.Globalization.NumberStyles.Float,System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture,out double value)||!double.IsFinite(value))throw new System.IO.InvalidDataException(L.T("유효한 숫자를 입력하세요."));return value;}
 void Mark(){Dirty=JsonSerializer.Serialize(clip)!=saved;lastFrame=null;}
 void RebindSelection(){var id=selected?.Id;selected=clip.Keys.FirstOrDefault(k=>k.Id==id);}
 void Edit(Action action){Pause();history.Begin(clip);try{action();FacialClipFile.Validate(clip);history.Commit(clip);RebindSelection();Mark();Refresh();ShowTime(true);}catch{var old=history.Cancel();if(old!=null)clip=old;RebindSelection();Refresh();ShowTime(true);throw;}}
 public void SetActive(bool value){if(active==value)return;EndMorphEdit(true);if(value&&!hasDocument){clip.Profile=current().Profile;hasDocument=true;}active=value;Pause();if(active)ShowTime(true);else display(null);ActiveChanged?.Invoke(value);}
 public void SetClip(FacialClip data,bool clean=true){FacialClipFile.Validate(data);var copy=JsonSerializer.Deserialize<FacialClip>(JsonSerializer.Serialize(data))!;Pause();clip=copy;hasDocument=true;selected=null;path=null;history.Clear();saved=clean?JsonSerializer.Serialize(clip):null;Mark();position=0;Refresh();timeline.ResetView();SetActive(true);ShowTime(true);}
 public void CommitName(string value){if(value==clip.Name)return;Edit(()=>clip.Name=value);}
 public void SetDuration(double seconds){if(!double.IsFinite(seconds)||seconds<=0||seconds>600)throw new System.IO.InvalidDataException(L.T("클립 길이는 0초 초과 600초 이하여야 합니다."));if(clip.Keys.Any(k=>k.Time>seconds))throw new System.IO.InvalidDataException(L.T("줄인 범위 밖에 키가 있습니다. 키를 먼저 이동하거나 삭제하세요. 키와 원래 길이를 유지합니다."));if(seconds==clip.Duration)return;Edit(()=>clip.Duration=seconds);position=Math.Min(position,clip.Duration);ShowTime(true);}
 public void SetSelectedProperties(double time,string mode){if(selected==null)return;if(!double.IsFinite(time)||mode is not ("Linear" or "Hold"))throw new System.IO.InvalidDataException(L.T("키 시간·보간이 잘못되었습니다."));if(time==selected.Time&&mode==selected.Interpolation)return;Edit(()=>{timeline.MoveKey(selected,time);selected.Interpolation=mode;});position=selected!.Time;timeline.Reveal(position);ShowTime(true);}
 public void Seek(double time){if(!double.IsFinite(time))throw new System.IO.InvalidDataException(L.T("시간이 유효하지 않습니다."));Pause();selected=null;position=Math.Clamp(time,0,clip.Duration);SyncSelection();ShowTime(true);timeline.Reveal(position);}
 public void SelectKey(FacialKey key){var live=clip.Keys.FirstOrDefault(k=>k.Id==key.Id);if(live==null)return;Pause();selected=live;position=live.Time;SyncSelection();ShowTime(true);}
 void SyncSelection(){updating=true;keyTime.IsEnabled=interpolation.IsEnabled=selected!=null;keyTime.Text=selected?.Time.ToString("R",System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)??"";interpolation.SelectedItem=selected?.Interpolation??"Linear";selectionLabel.Text=L.T(selected==null?"키 선택 없음":"선택한 키");updating=false;timeline.SelectMarker(selected?.Id);}
 public void AddAt(double time,Preset state,string? mode=null){var copy=FacialTimeline.Copy(state);SetActive(true);Edit(()=>{if(clip.Keys.Count==0)clip.Profile=copy.Profile;if(copy.Profile!=clip.Profile)throw new InvalidOperationException(L.T("프리셋과 클립의 종족 프로필이 다릅니다."));var key=clip.Keys.FirstOrDefault(k=>Math.Abs(k.Time-time)<1e-6);if(key==null){key=new(){Time=time};clip.Keys.Add(key);}key.State=copy;key.Interpolation=mode??interpolation.SelectedItem as string??"Linear";selected=key;clip.RequiredResources=clip.RequiredResources.Concat(copy.RequiredResources).Distinct().ToList();});if(selected!=null)SelectKey(selected);}
 public void BeginMorphEdit(){if(!Active||gesture)return;gesture=true;history.Begin(clip);}
 public void EndMorphEdit(bool canceled=false){if(!gesture)return;gesture=false;if(canceled){var old=history.Cancel();if(old!=null){clip=old;RebindSelection();Mark();Refresh();ShowTime(true);}}else{history.Commit(clip);Mark();}}
 public void Edited(Preset state){if(!Active)return;Pause();var key=clip.Keys.FirstOrDefault(k=>Math.Abs(k.Time-position)<1e-6);if(key==null&&autoKey.IsChecked!=true)return;bool own=!gesture;if(own)history.Begin(clip);try{if(clip.Keys.Count==0)clip.Profile=state.Profile;if(state.Profile!=clip.Profile)throw new InvalidOperationException(L.T("프리셋과 클립의 종족 프로필이 다릅니다."));if(key==null){key=new(){Time=position};clip.Keys.Add(key);}key.State=FacialTimeline.Copy(state);selected=key;FacialClipFile.Validate(clip);if(own){history.Commit(clip);Mark();}else{Dirty=true;lastFrame=null;}SyncSelection();timeline.Render();}catch{var old=history.Cancel();if(old!=null)clip=old;gesture=false;RebindSelection();Refresh();ShowTime(true);throw;}}
 public void Undo(){if(gesture){EndMorphEdit(true);return;}Pause();var old=history.Undo(clip);if(old!=null){clip=old;selected=null;Mark();Refresh();ShowTime(true);}}
 public void Redo(){if(gesture)return;Pause();var next=history.Redo(clip);if(next!=null){clip=next;selected=null;Mark();Refresh();ShowTime(true);}}
 public void DeleteKey(){if(selected==null)return;var id=selected.Id;Edit(()=>clip.Keys.RemoveAll(k=>k.Id==id));}
 public void CopyKey(){if(selected!=null)clipboard=new(){State=FacialTimeline.Copy(selected.State),Interpolation=selected.Interpolation};}
 public void Paste(){if(clipboard!=null)AddAt(position,clipboard.State,clipboard.Interpolation);}
 public void Pause(){playing=false;timer.Stop();clock.Stop();}
 public void TogglePlayback(){if(playing){Pause();ShowTime(true);return;}SetActive(true);selected=null;SyncSelection();timeline.FollowPlayback=true;anchor=position>=clip.Duration?0:position;clock.Restart();playing=true;ShowTime(true);timer.Start();}
 bool Discard(){if(!CommitPending())return false;return !Dirty||MessageBox.Show(L.T("클립의 미저장 변경을 버릴까요?"),L.T("클립"),MessageBoxButton.YesNo)==MessageBoxResult.Yes;}
 public void RefreshLanguage(){updating=true;int choice=lengths.SelectedIndex;lengths.ItemsSource=new[]{"0.5 s","1 s","2 s","5 s","10 s",L.T("직접 입력")};lengths.SelectedIndex=choice;updating=false;SyncSelection();}
 public bool CommitPending(){try{CommitName(title.Text);SetDuration(Number(duration));if(selected!=null)SetSelectedProperties(Number(keyTime),interpolation.SelectedItem as string??"Linear");return true;}catch(Exception e){Refresh();updating=true;try{MessageBox.Show(L.T(e.Message),L.T("표정 클립"));}finally{updating=false;}return false;}}
 public void CreateTransition(){var dialog=new TransitionDialog(opened()){Owner=Window.GetWindow(this)};if(dialog.ShowDialog()==true&&dialog.Result!=null&&Discard())SetClip(dialog.Result,false);}
 void Refresh(){updating=true;title.Text=clip.Name;duration.Text=clip.Duration.ToString("R",System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);int index=Array.IndexOf(new[]{.5,1,2,5,10},clip.Duration);lengths.SelectedIndex=index<0?5:index;duration.Visibility=lengths.SelectedIndex==5?Visibility.Visible:Visibility.Collapsed;position=Math.Clamp(position,0,clip.Duration);updating=false;SyncSelection();timeline.Render();zoomLabel.Text=$"{clip.Duration/timeline.Viewport.Span:0.##}× · {timeline.Viewport.Start:0.###}–{timeline.Viewport.End:0.###} s";lastFrame=null;}
 void ShowTime(bool force=false,bool playback=false){if(!positionBox.IsKeyboardFocusWithin)positionBox.Text=position.ToString("0.###",System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);endTime.Text=" / "+clip.Duration.ToString("0.###")+" s";timeline.UpdateCursor(playback);if(!Active)return;var state=clip.Evaluate(position);if(!force&&ChannelState.Equal(state,lastFrame))return;lastFrame=state;display(state);}
 void Open(){var dialog=new OpenFileDialog{Filter=L.T("표정 클립|*.facialclip.json;*.json")};if(dialog.ShowDialog()!=true)return;var loaded=FacialClipFile.Load(dialog.FileName);if(!Discard())return;SetClip(loaded);path=dialog.FileName;}
 public void Save(){if(!CommitPending())return;var dialog=new SaveFileDialog{Filter=L.T("표정 클립|*.facialclip.json"),FileName=path??"clip.facialclip.json"};if(dialog.ShowDialog()!=true)return;clip.RequiredResources=clip.RequiredResources.Concat(clip.Keys.SelectMany(k=>k.State.RequiredResources)).Distinct().ToList();FacialClipFile.Save(dialog.FileName,clip);path=dialog.FileName;saved=JsonSerializer.Serialize(clip);Dirty=false;}
 void Import(){var dialog=new OpenFileDialog{Filter=L.T("표정 프리셋|*.facialpreset.json;*.json")};if(dialog.ShowDialog()==true)AddAt(position,PresetFile.Load(dialog.FileName));}
 void ExportPreset(){var dialog=new SaveFileDialog{Filter=L.T("표정 프리셋|*.facialpreset.json"),FileName="frame.facialpreset.json"};if(dialog.ShowDialog()==true)PresetFile.Save(dialog.FileName,Active?clip.Evaluate(position):current());}
 public void CleanForSmoke(){Pause();Dirty=false;}
}
